{"4834200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Village Survivors", "steam_appid": 4834200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4885950], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Grab your pots and pans—defend your home!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An army has invaded a quiet village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No reinforcements, no heroes—just villagers armed with cleavers, hoes, and harpoons, standing as the last line of defense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 characters: Villager, Chef, Farmer, Blacksmith… each with a unique skill, and each brings new weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >39 weapons: Needle, Shovel, Pot, Logging Axe… unlock them all and build your own playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 stages × 5 difficulties: fight your way from the outskirts to the castle and beat an army with villagers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades: spend each run's gold on village upgrades to start stronger—or turn them off for an extra challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your way: weapons attack automatically, and you can switch between auto and manual aim anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced runs of about 20 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, mouse, and controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements and Steam Cloud saves.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Grab your pots and pans—defend your home!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An army has invaded a quiet village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No reinforcements, no heroes—just villagers armed with cleavers, hoes, and harpoons, standing as the last line of defense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\